#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:9
msgid "源码 SDK、版本与生成格式"
msgstr "Source SDK, versions, and generated formats"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:11
msgid ""
"Nexus 交付可重新装配的源码 SDK。消费方用同一配置、编译器与 ABI 重编平台、provider、生成 bindings "
"和调用者。当前不承诺稳定二进制 ABI。"
msgstr ""
"Nexus delivers a source SDK that can be reassembled. Consumers rebuild the "
"platform, provider, generated bindings, and callers with the same "
"configuration, compiler, and ABI. A stable binary ABI is not currently "
"promised."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:13
msgid "当前格式的唯一数据"
msgstr "Single source of current format data"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:15
msgid ""
"`dependencies/platform-compatibility.json` 是语义版本、factory 代际和各 schema "
"的唯一策略数据。`tools/configure/metadata.py` 是公共严格 loader。正文只解释字段，不维护另一份数值表。"
msgstr ""
"`dependencies/platform-compatibility.json` is the single policy data source "
"for the semantic version, factory generation, and schemas. "
"`tools/configure/metadata.py` is the common strict loader. Prose explains "
"the fields without maintaining another table of values."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "当前接口与格式策略；值由实际生产入口共同检查。"
msgstr ""
"Current interface and format policy; values are checked jointly by actual "
"production entry points."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "字段"
msgstr "Field"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "`semantic_version`"
msgstr "`semantic_version`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "CMake、生成头与 SDK 元数据共用的完整版本"
msgstr "Full version shared by CMake, generated headers, and SDK metadata"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "`factory_abi_epoch`"
msgstr "`factory_abi_epoch`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "当前生成源码接口代际；不是二进制 ABI 承诺"
msgstr ""
"Current generated-source interface generation; not a binary ABI promise"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "`schemas.assembly_authoring`"
msgstr "`schemas.assembly_authoring`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "唯一作者 TOML 输入格式"
msgstr "The only authored TOML input format"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "`schemas.assembly_projection`"
msgstr "`schemas.assembly_projection`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "`resolved.json` 单向审计输出格式"
msgstr "One-way audit output format for `resolved.json`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "`schemas.typed_ir`"
msgstr "`schemas.typed_ir`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "私有 Python 类型化源码合同"
msgstr "Private Python typed-source contract"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "Board/SoC/routes 与 CPU runtime schemas"
msgstr "Board/SoC/routes and CPU runtime schemas"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "各事实和装配入口的独立格式"
msgstr "Independent formats for the respective fact and assembly entry points"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "`schemas.source_sdk_manifest`"
msgstr "`schemas.source_sdk_manifest`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:17
msgid "已安装源码包的完整文件映射与导出声明"
msgstr ""
"Complete file mapping and export declarations for an installed source "
"package"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:32
msgid ""
"这些值分别负责自己的边界，不能互相替代。未知格式、未知字段、缺少策略、布尔伪整数、非规范版本和 symlink "
"输入均拒绝；校验不会选择替代硬件或静默修复输入。"
msgstr ""
"Each value governs its own boundary and cannot replace another. Unknown "
"formats, unknown fields, missing policy, booleans used as integers, "
"noncanonical versions, and symlink inputs are rejected. Validation never "
"selects substitute hardware or silently repairs inputs."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:34
msgid ""
"factory 的紧凑 ID 只在该 bundle 内有意义。它返回已有静态接口，不初始化硬件；ID 不可持久化后跨 bundle 使用。所有 "
"Platform bundle 都生成 strong factory，未选类别没有 getter/ID，普通调用检查 NULL 及生命周期状态。"
msgstr ""
"Factory compact IDs are meaningful only within their bundle. The factory "
"returns existing static interfaces without initializing hardware; IDs must "
"not be persisted for use across bundles. Every Platform bundle generates a "
"strong factory. Unselected classes have no getter/ID; ordinary callers check"
" NULL and lifecycle state."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:36
msgid "SDK 文件映射与导出"
msgstr "SDK file mapping and exports"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:38
msgid ""
"Manifest 的 `source_exports` 记录实际导出的平台成员和包身份，每个成员接受 `files_sha256` "
"字节校验。包声明生产导出范围；CMake 仍拥有唯一编译图。导出范围不是某个 ELF 的翻译单元闭包。"
msgstr ""
"The manifest's `source_exports` records actual exported platform members and"
" package identities. Every member undergoes `files_sha256` byte "
"verification. Packages declare production export scope; CMake still owns the"
" single compilation graph. Export scope is not the translation-unit closure "
"of a particular ELF."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:40
msgid ""
"`profile` 明确记录 backend、components、host_support 与 packages。默认包来自策略的 "
"`source_sdk.default_package_manifests`；新增家族不自动进入 "
"SDK。验证使用导出时冻结的包选择，不把未选库存补入已安装包。"
msgstr ""
"`profile` explicitly records backend, components, host_support, and "
"packages. Default packages come from the policy's "
"`source_sdk.default_package_manifests`; adding a family does not place it in"
" the SDK automatically. Verification uses package selection frozen at export"
" time and does not add unselected inventory to an installed package."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:42
msgid ""
"消费方使用该 SDK 自己的 verifier 和 resolver。严格验证拒绝缺失、额外、修改或 symlinked payload，以及 "
"expected revision/版本不一致。源码 checkout 与安装 SDK 分别记录自身来源；消费者目录的 Git 身份不能代替 SDK "
"来源。"
msgstr ""
"Consumers use the SDK's own verifier and resolver. Strict verification "
"rejects missing, extra, modified, or symlinked payloads and expected "
"revision/version mismatches. A source checkout and an installed SDK each "
"record their own provenance; the consumer directory's Git identity cannot "
"replace SDK provenance."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:44
msgid "当前检查与升级"
msgstr "Current checks and upgrades"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:46
msgid ""
"从完整仓库根准备所选工具后运行 `python tools/maintenance/compatibility.py`。`--generated` "
"指向真实生成的 `nexus_config.h`，`--sdk` 指向安装包的 `share/nexus/src`。工具观察生产 "
"validator/emission、实际事实和真实 CMake 版本测试，结束前复验参与字节。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare the selected tools from a complete repository root, then run `python"
" tools/maintenance/compatibility.py`. `--generated` points to the actual "
"generated `nexus_config.h`; `--sdk` points to the installed package's "
"`share/nexus/src`. The tool observes production validation/emission, actual "
"facts, and real CMake version tests, then rechecks participating bytes "
"before finishing."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:48
msgid ""
"一致性只证明被检查元数据相符，不能替代软件执行、镜像资源、签名或物理验收。版本或格式行为改变先记录真实拒绝/接受回归，再修改唯一策略和实际入口。没有实现的格式不得被声明可接受。"
msgstr ""
"Consistency establishes only that the inspected metadata agrees; it cannot "
"replace software execution, image resource checks, signatures, or physical "
"acceptance. When version or format behavior changes, record real "
"rejection/acceptance regressions before modifying the single policy and "
"actual entry points. An unimplemented format must not be declared "
"acceptable."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:50
msgid ""
"更换 SDK 的操作见[使用源码 SDK](../../guides/use-source-sdk.md)：更新精确 pin/锁、验证选中内容、使用独立"
" builddir、重新生成并重编所有调用者。产品持久化格式、密钥和恢复政策不由平台自动升级。"
msgstr ""
"See [Use the source SDK](../../guides/use-source-sdk.md) for SDK "
"replacement: update the exact pin/lock, verify selected content, use a "
"separate builddir, regenerate, and recompile all callers. The platform does "
"not automatically upgrade product persistence formats, keys, or recovery "
"policies."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/sdk-format.md:52
msgid ""
"依赖的组织 fork、gitlink、许可证和按任务准备规则见[依赖维护](../../development/dependencies.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [dependency maintenance](../../development/dependencies.md) for "
"organization forks, gitlinks, licenses, and preparation rules by task."
